{"description":"When the owner was charged a fee and you can see it (a Stripe, PayPal or Square payment detail, a statement line), send the route, the payment amount, the fee charged and the date. Returns the published fee for that payment, the difference, and a one-line reading: matches, promo (fee waived or reduced for a while), likely_negotiated (lower than published), or possible_hidden_extra (higher; names the published extra that explains it, such as an international card, when one does). Use it to answer 'was I overcharged?'. Each report also tells PaidRouter how real fees compare to published ones. Send only these numbers; nothing about the payer. Up to 100 reports per key per day.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"amount":{"description":"Payment amount in USD","exclusiveMinimum":0,"type":"number"},"charged_on":{"description":"YYYY-MM-DD","pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"extras":{"description":"Anything the statement says about the fee, e.g. 'international card', 'promo rate'. Not stored.","maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"fee_charged":{"description":"Fee the provider took on that payment, USD","type":"number"},"route":{"description":"Route id, e.g. stripe_card, paypal_checkout, venmo_business","enum":["quickbooks_payments_invoice_card","quickbooks_payments_desktop_invoice_card","freshbooks_invoice_card","wave_invoice_card","xero_invoice_card","zoho_payments_card_online","bill_com_invoice_card","honeybook_invoice_card","bonsai_invoice_card","housecall_pro_invoice_card","godaddy_payments_card_online","godaddy_payments_invoice_card","wix_payments_card_online","squarespace_payments_card_online","squarespace_payments_card_online_plus","squarespace_payments_card_online_advanced","square_card_online","square_card_online_square_premium","sumup_invoice_card","paypal_invoice_card","airwallex_card_online","stripe_card","square_card","paypal_checkout","paypal_ca